  "articleBody": "A successful interior lighting upgrade starts with the room’s purpose, existing wiring, ceiling access, control preferences, and the remodeling scope. A coordinated design-build team can evaluate fixture placement, task and ambient layers, dimming, electrical changes, finishes, and applicable California requirements before construction begins, helping the quote reflect the complete installation rather than fixtures alone.",
